  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: regexp: out-of-bounds repeat stack access in Onigmo\n     when the range-repeat or null-check ID overflows its internal type\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-110264.patch: reject overflowed IDs\n     - CVE-2026-110264\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: regexp: wrapped jump offsets in Onigmo from an integer\n     overflow in the quantifier expansion size check and from compiled\n     programs too big for their offset type\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-93577-CVE-2026-97229.patch: check the\n       expansion size by division and cap the compiled program size\n     - CVE-2026-93577\n     - CVE-2026-97229\n   * debian/rules: run test-all for test/ruby/test_regexp.rb only; the full\n     suite aborts with a core dump after the last test on the build system",
